<title>FRANCE: Coflexip Stena wins UK contract.</title>
<headline>Coflexip Stena wins UK contract.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coflexip Stena Offshore said on Thursday that Coflexip Stena Offshore Ltd, a British unit of the group, was awarded an EPIC contract for the Shell U.K. Exploration and Production Curlew project by the MAS Alliance.</p>
<p>The company gave no financial details.</p>
<p>The MAS alliance is made up of Maersk Contractors and AMEC Process &amp; Energy and SBM Inc of Monaco, Coflexip said.</p>
<p>The Shell U.K. Exploration and Production operates in the British sector of the North Sea on behalf of Shell and Esso, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
